'' 'len( u )' over a UDT calls the 'operator len' declared for ITS type, or the intrinsic when
'' there is none: tiko's lowering called the chain head, another type's operator -- 77 where
'' fbc prints 12 (overload re-pick refactor: Check decides, lowering reads the record).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/operator-len-other-type.bas -o tests/codegen/operatorlenothertype.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/operatorlenothertype.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  77             12            12
